msgid "Final survey"
msgstr "Završna anketa"

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:293
msgid "We sincerely thank you for your commitment to this project!"
msgstr "Iskreno vam zahvaljujemo na predanosti ovom projektu!"

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:296
msgid ""
"This is the third and final survey in the project, following the initial "
"ones you completed before and after\n"
"      soil sampling. The majority of questions are consistent with the "
"previous surveys so that we can accurately\n"
"      measure changes over time and understand the impact of project "
"participation."
msgstr ""
"Ovo je treća i posljednja anketa u projektu, nakon početnih anketa koje ste "
"ispunili prije i nakon\n"
"      uzorkovanja tla. Većina pitanja podudara se s prethodnim anketama kako"
" bismo mogli točno\n"
"      mjeriti promjene tijekom vremena i razumjeti utjecaj sudjelovanja u "
"projektu."

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:301
msgid ""
"Before you start: please only complete this survey if the lab results from "
"your soil sample(s) have already\n"
"      been added to the repository. If the results are pending, please check"
" back at a later time."
msgstr ""
"Prije početka: ispunite ovu anketu samo ako su laboratorijski rezultati "
"vašeg uzorka ili uzoraka tla već\n"
"      dodani u repozitorij. Ako rezultati još nisu dostupni, vratite se "
"kasnije."

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:307
msgid "Go to final survey"
msgstr "Idi na završnu anketu"

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:312
msgid "Data use information"
msgstr "Informacije o korištenju podataka"

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:317
msgid "I have already completed it"
msgstr "Već sam ispunio/la anketu"

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:322
msgid "Processing survey data in the ECHO project"
msgstr "Obrada podataka iz ankete u projektu ECHO"

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:324
msgid ""
"The objective of this survey data is to examine the impact of project "
"participation on participant\n"
"        attitudes and motivation towards soil."
msgstr ""
"Cilj podataka iz ove ankete jest ispitati utjecaj sudjelovanja u projektu na"
" stavove sudionika\n"
"        i njihovu motivaciju u odnosu na tlo."

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:328
msgid ""
"Your information will only be used for scientific purposes. We do not "
"collect names or addresses. Your\n"
"        details regarding age and gender are only used for statistical "
"purposes and all details are collected and\n"
"        evaluated anonymously. It is not possible to draw conclusions about "
"your person at any time."
msgstr ""
"Vaši će se podaci koristiti isključivo u znanstvene svrhe. Ne prikupljamo "
"imena ni adrese. Podaci\n"
"        o vašoj dobi i spolu koriste se samo u statističke svrhe, a svi se "
"podaci prikupljaju i\n"
"        obrađuju anonimno. Ni u jednom trenutku nije moguće utvrditi vaš "
"identitet na temelju tih podataka."

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:333
msgid ""
"Answering each question in the survey is most appreciated as it plays a "
"crucial role in providing valuable\n"
"        insights that enhance the relevance and impact of the ECHO project. "
"Your honest responses are essential for\n"
"        understanding how engagement with the project influences attitudes "
"and motivations, ensuring the project’s\n"
"        outcomes are meaningful and well-informed."
msgstr ""
"Bili bismo vam zahvalni ako odgovorite na svako pitanje u anketi jer to ima "
"ključnu ulogu u pružanju vrijednih\n"
"        uvida koji povećavaju relevantnost i učinak projekta ECHO. Vaši "
"iskreni odgovori ključni su za\n"
"        razumijevanje načina na koji sudjelovanje u projektu utječe na "
"stavove i motivaciju te pomažu osigurati da\n"
"        rezultati projekta budu smisleni i utemeljeni na dobrim "
"informacijama."

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:339
msgid ""
"The survey will take approximately 8–10 minutes to complete. Please find a "
"quiet space where you won’t be\n"
"        interrupted. There are no right or wrong answers — answer "
"spontaneously."
msgstr ""
"Ispunjavanje ankete traje približno 8–10 minuta. Pronađite mirno mjesto na "
"kojem vas nitko neće\n"
"        ometati. Nema točnih ni netočnih odgovora — odgovarajte spontano."

#: echorepo/templates/results.html:343
msgid ""
"Based on the information provided to you, please consent to participate in "
